error[template/bad-filter-argument]: `picture` needs `alt`, which says what the image shows
 --> templates/no-alt.html:1:32
  |
1 | {{ image("/photos/logo.svg") | picture(class="logo") }}
  |                                ^^^^^^^
  |
  = note: checked as the Template of the Route `no-alt`
  = help: write `alt=""` for an image that is only decoration
